# Nothing this package produces belongs in git. install.sh writes only to the
# prefix and bin dir you choose, and the test suite writes only to its scratch
# root — so this list is purely defensive.

# Scaffolding a session would drop here if an agent is ever run in this repo.
# The launcher already hides and removes these, but belt and braces.
/.claude/agents/
/.codex/agents/
/DEVLOG.md

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
